# Server Setup

The server serves Scramjet files, `/sw.js`, your static frontend build, and a default Wisp server.

## Installation

Install the `chemicaljs` package:

```bash
npm install chemicaljs
```

## Usage

Import `Chemical` and create a new server instance. The server is built on top of Express.

```js
import { Chemical } from "chemicaljs";

const server = new Chemical({
  port: 8000,
  staticDir: "build",
  spaMode: false,
});

await server.start();
```

| Option | Type | Default | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `port` | `number` | `8000` | Port the HTTP and Wisp server listens on. |
| `staticDir` | `string` | `"build"` | Directory containing your built frontend files. |
| `spaMode` | `boolean` | `false` | Serves `index.html` on unmatched `GET` routes. |

Call `server.stop()` to shut down the server.
